{"seq":2,"slug":"coroutine-and-async","title":"协程与异步编程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unity-development/unity-scripting/coroutine-and-async","wordCount":1072,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"协程与异步编程\">协程与异步编程</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Unity 的协程（Coroutine）是一种基于迭代器的协作式多任务机制，允许将需要跨越多帧执行的操作写成顺序代码。协程并非多线程，它运行在主线程上，通过 <code>yield return</code> 语句在每帧之间暂停和恢复执行。除了协程之外，Unity 还支持 C# 原生的 async/await 异步编程模式以及 UniTask 等第三方方案，各有适用场景。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 协程执行模型&#10;        A[StartCoroutine] --&gt; B[执行到 yield]&#10;        B --&gt; C{yield 类型}&#10;        C --&gt;|null| D[下一帧 Update 后继续]&#10;        C --&gt;|WaitForSeconds| E[等待指定秒数]&#10;        C --&gt;|WaitForFixedUpdate| F[下一次 FixedUpdate 后]&#10;        C --&gt;|WaitForEndOfFrame| G[当前帧渲染后]&#10;        C --&gt;|WaitUntil| H[条件满足时]&#10;        C --&gt;|其他协程| I[嵌套协程完成时]&#10;        D --&gt; B&#10;        E --&gt; B&#10;        F --&gt; B&#10;        G --&gt; B&#10;        H --&gt; B&#10;        I --&gt; B&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 协程执行模型\n        A[StartCoroutine] --&gt; B[执行到 yield]\n        B --&gt; C{yield 类型}\n        C --&gt;|null| D[下一帧 Update 后继续]\n        C --&gt;|WaitForSeconds| E[等待指定秒数]\n        C --&gt;|WaitForFixedUpdate| F[下一次 FixedUpdate 后]\n        C --&gt;|WaitForEndOfFrame| G[当前帧渲染后]\n        C --&gt;|WaitUntil| H[条件满足时]\n        C --&gt;|其他协程| I[嵌套协程完成时]\n        D --&gt; B\n        E --&gt; B\n        F --&gt; B\n        G --&gt; B\n        H --&gt; B\n        I --&gt; B\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>异步方案</th>\n<th>运行线程</th>\n<th>GC 分配</th>\n<th>取消机制</th>\n<th>异常处理</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Coroutine</td>\n<td>主线程</td>\n<td>每次 yield 产生</td>\n<td>StopCoroutine</td>\n<td>无法 try-catch</td>\n<td>延时、动画序列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>async/await</td>\n<td>主线程/线程池</td>\n<td>状态机分配</td>\n<td>CancellationToken</td>\n<td>try-catch 支持</td>\n<td>I/O、网络请求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UniTask</td>\n<td>主线程</td>\n<td>零分配（结构体）</td>\n<td>CancellationToken</td>\n<td>try-catch 支持</td>\n<td>高性能异步全场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Invoke/InvokeRepeating</td>\n<td>主线程</td>\n<td>反射开销</td>\n<td>CancelInvoke</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>简单延时回调</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"协程调度机制\">协程调度机制</h2><p>协程的核心在于 <code>IEnumerator</code> 迭代器和 <code>yield return</code> 关键字。Unity 引擎维护了一个协程调度器，每帧在特定时间点检查所有活跃协程的等待条件，条件满足时恢复执行到下一个 yield 语句。</p>\n<p>不同的 yield 指令决定了协程在帧循环中的恢复时机。理解这些时机对于编写正确的协程逻辑至关重要：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>yield 类型</th>\n<th>恢复时机</th>\n<th>常见用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>yield return null</td>\n<td>下一帧 Update 之后</td>\n<td>分帧处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>yield return new WaitForSeconds(t)</td>\n<td>t 秒后（受 Time.timeScale 影响）</td>\n<td>延时操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>yield return new WaitForSecondsRealtime(t)</td>\n<td>t 秒后（不受 timeScale 影响）</td>\n<td>暂停菜单计时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>yield return new WaitForFixedUpdate()</td>\n<td>下一次 FixedUpdate 之后</td>\n<td>物理相关等待</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>yield return new WaitForEndOfFrame()</td>\n<td>当前帧渲染完成后</td>\n<td>截屏、后处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>yield return new WaitUntil(pred)</td>\n<td>谓词返回 true 时</td>\n<td>条件等待</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>yield return new WaitWhile(pred)</td>\n<td>谓词返回 false 时</td>\n<td>条件等待</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>yield return StartCoroutine(other)</td>\n<td>嵌套协程完成时</td>\n<td>协程编排</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;using System.Collections;&#10;&#10;public class WaveSpawner : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    [SerializeField] private GameObject enemyPrefab;&#10;    [SerializeField] private Transform[] spawnPoints;&#10;    [SerializeField] private int enemiesPerWave = 5;&#10;    [SerializeField] private float spawnInterval = 0.5f;&#10;    [SerializeField] private float waveCooldown = 10f;&#10;&#10;    private void Start()&#10;    {&#10;        StartCoroutine(SpawnWaves());&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private IEnumerator SpawnWaves()&#10;    {&#10;        int waveNumber = 0;&#10;&#10;        while (true)&#10;        {&#10;            waveNumber++;&#10;            yield return StartCoroutine(SpawnWave(waveNumber));&#10;            yield return new WaitForSeconds(waveCooldown);&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private IEnumerator SpawnWave(int wave)&#10;    {&#10;        int count = enemiesPerWave + wave * 2;&#10;&#10;        for (int i = 0; i &lt; count; i++)&#10;        {&#10;            Transform point = spawnPoints[Random.Range(0, spawnPoints.Length)];&#10;            Instantiate(enemyPrefab, point.position, point.rotation);&#10;            yield return new WaitForSeconds(spawnInterval);&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using System.Collections;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class WaveSpawner : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private GameObject enemyPrefab;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private Transform[] spawnPoints;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private int enemiesPerWave = 5;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private float spawnInterval = 0.5f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private float waveCooldown = 10f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void Start()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        StartCoroutine(SpawnWaves());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private IEnumerator SpawnWaves()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        int waveNumber = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        while (true)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            waveNumber++;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            yield return StartCoroutine(SpawnWave(waveNumber));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            yield return new WaitForSeconds(waveCooldown);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private IEnumerator SpawnWave(int wave)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        int count = enemiesPerWave + wave * 2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        for (int i = 0; i &#x3C; count; i++)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Transform point = spawnPoints[Random.Range(0, spawnPoints.Length)];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Instantiate(enemyPrefab, point.position, point.rotation);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            yield return new WaitForSeconds(spawnInterval);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"协程的生命周期管理\">协程的生命周期管理</h2><p>协程的启动与停止需要精确管理，否则容易出现内存泄漏或逻辑残留。协程与启动它的 MonoBehaviour 绑定，当 GameObject 被禁用或销毁时，所有绑定的协程自动停止。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[StartCoroutine] --&gt; B{协程运行中}&#10;    B --&gt;|正常结束| C[迭代器耗尽]&#10;    B --&gt;|手动停止| D[StopCoroutine]&#10;    B --&gt;|停止全部| E[StopAllCoroutines]&#10;    B --&gt;|对象禁用| F[GameObject.SetActive false]&#10;    B --&gt;|组件禁用| G[enabled = false 不停止]&#10;    B --&gt;|对象销毁| H[Destroy]&#10;    F --&gt; I[协程暂停]&#10;    I --&gt;|重新激活| J[协程不恢复]\">graph TD\n    A[StartCoroutine] --&gt; B{协程运行中}\n    B --&gt;|正常结束| C[迭代器耗尽]\n    B --&gt;|手动停止| D[StopCoroutine]\n    B --&gt;|停止全部| E[StopAllCoroutines]\n    B --&gt;|对象禁用| F[GameObject.SetActive false]\n    B --&gt;|组件禁用| G[enabled = false 不停止]\n    B --&gt;|对象销毁| H[Destroy]\n    F --&gt; I[协程暂停]\n    I --&gt;|重新激活| J[协程不恢复]</pre><p>正确管理协程引用是避免问题的关键。通过缓存 Coroutine 引用可以精确控制特定协程的停止：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;using System.Collections;&#10;&#10;public class AbilitySystem : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    [SerializeField] private float cooldownDuration = 3f;&#10;    [SerializeField] private float channelDuration = 2f;&#10;&#10;    private Coroutine cooldownRoutine;&#10;    private Coroutine channelRoutine;&#10;    private bool isCoolingDown;&#10;    private bool isChanneling;&#10;&#10;    public void UseAbility()&#10;    {&#10;        if (isCoolingDown || isChanneling) return;&#10;&#10;        channelRoutine = StartCoroutine(ChannelAbility());&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void CancelChannel()&#10;    {&#10;        if (channelRoutine != null)&#10;        {&#10;            StopCoroutine(channelRoutine);&#10;            channelRoutine = null;&#10;            isChanneling = false;&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private IEnumerator ChannelAbility()&#10;    {&#10;        isChanneling = true;&#10;        yield return new WaitForSeconds(channelDuration);&#10;        isChanneling = false;&#10;&#10;        ExecuteAbility();&#10;&#10;        cooldownRoutine = StartCoroutine(Cooldown());&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private IEnumerator Cooldown()&#10;    {&#10;        isCoolingDown = true;&#10;        yield return new WaitForSeconds(cooldownDuration);&#10;        isCoolingDown = false;&#10;        cooldownRoutine = null;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void ExecuteAbility()&#10;    {&#10;        Debug.Log(&quot;技能释放！&quot;);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void OnDisable()&#10;    {&#10;        isCoolingDown = false;&#10;        isChanneling = false;&#10;        cooldownRoutine = null;&#10;        channelRoutine = null;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using System.Collections;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class AbilitySystem : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private float cooldownDuration = 3f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private float channelDuration = 2f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private Coroutine cooldownRoutine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private Coroutine channelRoutine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private bool isCoolingDown;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private bool isChanneling;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void UseAbility()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (isCoolingDown || isChanneling) return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        channelRoutine = StartCoroutine(ChannelAbility());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void CancelChannel()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (channelRoutine != null)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            StopCoroutine(channelRoutine);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            channelRoutine = null;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            isChanneling = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private IEnumerator ChannelAbility()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        isChanneling = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        yield return new WaitForSeconds(channelDuration);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        isChanneling = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ExecuteAbility();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        cooldownRoutine = StartCoroutine(Cooldown());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private IEnumerator Cooldown()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        isCoolingDown = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        yield return new WaitForSeconds(cooldownDuration);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        isCoolingDown = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        cooldownRoutine = null;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void ExecuteAbility()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Debug.Log(\"技能释放！\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void OnDisable()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        isCoolingDown = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        isChanneling = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        cooldownRoutine = null;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        channelRoutine = null;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>需要注意的关键陷阱：<code>SetActive(false)</code> 会停止所有协程且重新激活后不会恢复；禁用组件（<code>enabled = false</code>）不会停止协程但 <code>OnDisable</code> 会被调用；<code>StopCoroutine</code> 传入字符串和传入引用是不同的 API。</p>\n<h2 id=\"async-await-与-awaitable\">async/await 与 Awaitable</h2><p>Unity 2023+ 引入了原生的 <code>Awaitable</code> 类型，使得 async/await 可以直接在 Unity 生命周期中使用，无需第三方库。<code>Awaitable</code> 提供了与协程 yield 指令对应的异步等待方法，同时支持 <code>CancellationToken</code> 实现优雅的取消机制。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;using System.Threading;&#10;&#10;public class AsyncDialogueSystem : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    [SerializeField] private DialogueUI dialogueUI;&#10;    [SerializeField] private float typingSpeed = 0.05f;&#10;&#10;    private CancellationTokenSource cts;&#10;&#10;    public async void StartDialogue(string[] lines)&#10;    {&#10;        cts?.Cancel();&#10;        cts = new CancellationTokenSource();&#10;&#10;        try&#10;        {&#10;            foreach (string line in lines)&#10;            {&#10;                await TypeText(line, cts.Token);&#10;                await WaitForInput(cts.Token);&#10;            }&#10;            dialogueUI.Hide();&#10;        }&#10;        catch (OperationCanceledException)&#10;        {&#10;            dialogueUI.Hide();&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private async Awaitable TypeText(string text, CancellationToken token)&#10;    {&#10;        dialogueUI.ClearText();&#10;&#10;        foreach (char c in text)&#10;        {&#10;            token.ThrowIfCancellationRequested();&#10;            dialogueUI.AppendChar(c);&#10;            await Awaitable.WaitForSecondsAsync(typingSpeed, token);&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private async Awaitable WaitForInput(CancellationToken token)&#10;    {&#10;        while (!Input.GetButtonDown(&quot;Submit&quot;))&#10;        {&#10;            token.ThrowIfCancellationRequested();&#10;            await Awaitable.NextFrameAsync(token);&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void OnDestroy()&#10;    {&#10;        cts?.Cancel();&#10;        cts?.Dispose();&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using System.Threading;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class AsyncDialogueSystem : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private DialogueUI dialogueUI;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private float typingSpeed = 0.05f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private CancellationTokenSource cts;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public async void StartDialogue(string[] lines)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        cts?.Cancel();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        cts = new CancellationTokenSource();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        try</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            foreach (string line in lines)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                await TypeText(line, cts.Token);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                await WaitForInput(cts.Token);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            dialogueUI.Hide();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        catch (OperationCanceledException)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            dialogueUI.Hide();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private async Awaitable TypeText(string text, CancellationToken token)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        dialogueUI.ClearText();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        foreach (char c in text)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            token.ThrowIfCancellationRequested();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            dialogueUI.AppendChar(c);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            await Awaitable.WaitForSecondsAsync(typingSpeed, token);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private async Awaitable WaitForInput(CancellationToken token)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        while (!Input.GetButtonDown(\"Submit\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            token.ThrowIfCancellationRequested();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            await Awaitable.NextFrameAsync(token);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void OnDestroy()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        cts?.Cancel();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        cts?.Dispose();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>async/await 相比协程的核心优势在于异常处理能力和返回值支持。协程无法使用 try-catch 捕获异常，也无法直接返回计算结果，而 async 方法可以：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>能力</th>\n<th>Coroutine</th>\n<th>async/await (Awaitable)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>异常传播</td>\n<td>静默失败</td>\n<td>try-catch 捕获</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>返回值</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>支持泛型返回</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>取消机制</td>\n<td>StopCoroutine</td>\n<td>CancellationToken</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>嵌套组合</td>\n<td>yield return 嵌套</td>\n<td>await 链式调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>条件等待</td>\n<td>WaitUntil/WaitWhile</td>\n<td>循环 + NextFrameAsync</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线程切换</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>Awaitable.BackgroundThreadAsync</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"协程性能优化策略\">协程性能优化策略</h2><p>协程每次 <code>yield return new WaitForSeconds()</code> 都会产生堆内存分配，在高频调用场景下会加重 GC 压力。通过缓存 yield 对象可以显著降低分配：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;using System.Collections;&#10;using System.Collections.Generic;&#10;&#10;public static class YieldCache&#10;{&#10;    private static readonly Dictionary&lt;float, WaitForSeconds&gt; waitCache = new();&#10;    private static readonly WaitForEndOfFrame endOfFrame = new();&#10;    private static readonly WaitForFixedUpdate fixedUpdate = new();&#10;&#10;    public static WaitForSeconds Seconds(float time)&#10;    {&#10;        if (!waitCache.TryGetValue(time, out var wait))&#10;        {&#10;            wait = new WaitForSeconds(time);&#10;            waitCache[time] = wait;&#10;        }&#10;        return wait;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public static WaitForEndOfFrame EndOfFrame =&gt; endOfFrame;&#10;    public static WaitForFixedUpdate FixedUpdate =&gt; fixedUpdate;&#10;}&#10;&#10;public class OptimizedSpawner : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    private IEnumerator SpawnLoop()&#10;    {&#10;        while (true)&#10;        {&#10;            SpawnEnemy();&#10;            yield return YieldCache.Seconds(2f);&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void SpawnEnemy()&#10;    {&#10;        Debug.Log(&quot;敌人生成&quot;);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using System.Collections;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using System.Collections.Generic;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public static class YieldCache</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private static readonly Dictionary&#x3C;float, WaitForSeconds> waitCache = new();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private static readonly WaitForEndOfFrame endOfFrame = new();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private static readonly WaitForFixedUpdate fixedUpdate = new();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public static WaitForSeconds Seconds(float time)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (!waitCache.TryGetValue(time, out var wait))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            wait = new WaitForSeconds(time);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            waitCache[time] = wait;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return wait;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public static WaitForEndOfFrame EndOfFrame => endOfFrame;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public static WaitForFixedUpdate FixedUpdate => fixedUpdate;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class OptimizedSpawner : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private IEnumerator SpawnLoop()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        while (true)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            SpawnEnemy();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            yield return YieldCache.Seconds(2f);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void SpawnEnemy()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Debug.Log(\"敌人生成\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>分帧处理是协程的另一个重要应用场景，可以将大量计算分散到多帧中执行，避免单帧卡顿：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;using System.Collections;&#10;using System.Collections.Generic;&#10;&#10;public class ChunkLoader : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    [SerializeField] private int itemsPerFrame = 50;&#10;&#10;    public IEnumerator LoadItems&lt;T&gt;(List&lt;T&gt; items, System.Action&lt;T&gt; processAction)&#10;    {&#10;        for (int i = 0; i &lt; items.Count; i++)&#10;        {&#10;            processAction(items[i]);&#10;&#10;            if ((i + 1) % itemsPerFrame == 0)&#10;            {&#10;                yield return null;&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using System.Collections;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using System.Collections.Generic;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class ChunkLoader : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private int itemsPerFrame = 50;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public IEnumerator LoadItems&#x3C;T>(List&#x3C;T> items, System.Action&#x3C;T> processAction)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        for (int i = 0; i &#x3C; items.Count; i++)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            processAction(items[i]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if ((i + 1) % itemsPerFrame == 0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                yield return null;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((协程与异步编程))&#10;    协程基础&#10;      IEnumerator 迭代器&#10;      yield return 暂停恢复&#10;      主线程协作式调度&#10;    yield 指令&#10;      WaitForSeconds 延时&#10;      WaitUntil 条件等待&#10;      WaitForFixedUpdate 物理&#10;      嵌套协程编排&#10;    生命周期管理&#10;      Coroutine 引用缓存&#10;      StopCoroutine 精确停止&#10;      SetActive 自动停止&#10;    async/await&#10;      Awaitable 原生支持&#10;      CancellationToken 取消&#10;      try-catch 异常处理&#10;      返回值支持&#10;    性能优化&#10;      yield 对象缓存&#10;      分帧处理大数据&#10;      减少 GC 分配\">mindmap\n  root((协程与异步编程))\n    协程基础\n      IEnumerator 迭代器\n      yield return 暂停恢复\n      主线程协作式调度\n    yield 指令\n      WaitForSeconds 延时\n      WaitUntil 条件等待\n      WaitForFixedUpdate 物理\n      嵌套协程编排\n    生命周期管理\n      Coroutine 引用缓存\n      StopCoroutine 精确停止\n      SetActive 自动停止\n    async/await\n      Awaitable 原生支持\n      CancellationToken 取消\n      try-catch 异常处理\n      返回值支持\n    性能优化\n      yield 对象缓存\n      分帧处理大数据\n      减少 GC 分配</pre><ul>\n<li>协程是基于迭代器的协作式多任务机制，运行在主线程上，通过 yield return 暂停和恢复</li>\n<li>不同 yield 指令决定协程在帧循环中的恢复时机，理解时机是编写正确协程的关键</li>\n<li>协程与 MonoBehaviour 生命周期绑定，GameObject 禁用会停止协程且不可恢复</li>\n<li>async/await 配合 Awaitable 提供了异常处理、返回值和取消机制的完整异步方案</li>\n<li>缓存 WaitForSeconds 等 yield 对象可以避免重复的堆内存分配</li>\n<li>分帧处理模式适合将大量数据加载或计算分散到多帧执行</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"协程与异步编程","id":"协程与异步编程"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"协程调度机制","id":"协程调度机制"},{"level":2,"text":"协程的生命周期管理","id":"协程的生命周期管理"},{"level":2,"text":"async/await 与 Awaitable","id":"async-await-与-awaitable"},{"level":2,"text":"协程性能优化策略","id":"协程性能优化策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"MonoBehaviour 生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unity-development/unity-scripting/monobehaviour-lifecycle"},"next":{"title":"事件系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unity-development/unity-scripting/event-system"}}